    "title": "SCRYPT Takes Licensed Stablecoin Settlement Into East Africa",
    "summary": "Norman Wooding, co-founder and CEO of SCRYPT, on why Kenya, Tanzania, Rwanda and Uganda are the proving ground for licensed stablecoin settlement.\nThe post SCRYPT Takes Licensed Stablecoin Settlement Into East Africa appeared first on The Fintech Times.",
    "hasSummary": true,
    "link": "https://thefintechtimes.com/scrypt-takes-licensed-stablecoin-settlement-into-east-africa/",
