    "summary": "Egypt's largest fintech float since 2021 is testing institutional appetite for high-growth emerging-market listings at a $750m valuation.\nThe post MNT-Halan Opens $150m IPO Subscription on Cairo Bourse appeared first on The Fintech Times.",
